note Creating an anchor from a span of a SourceFile picks the innermost symbol whose range contains the span and stores offsets from that symbol's first line. With no containing symbol the offsets are absolute and the anchor is as fragile as a line number, which is why whole-symbol steps are preferred. None when the span runs past the file's text.

