note A step: the anchor plus what the path hangs on it. The id is set once when the step is made and is how the file names a parent and how diff matches a step; order places it in the step list, ordering siblings the code does not; parent (an id, none for a root) makes the path a tree; then the author, the note and the link to another path. resolution is filled in per session by resolve and never written to disk. Fields change only through the Map's methods.

