note A step's id: six base36 digits of an FNV-1a hash of a seed, moved past ids the path already holds by hashing again with a counter. add_step seeds it with the path name, file, symbol, offsets and parent id. The digits spread new steps across the file, and two branches that add the same step add the same id and the same lines.

